    <p id="pwa-status"></p>
    <p><strong>iPhone / iPad</strong><br>Open an HTTPS link in Safari, tap Share, then Add to Home Screen and Open as Web App if offered.</p>
    <p><strong>Android</strong><br>Open an HTTPS link in Chrome, then use Install app or Add to Home screen in the browser menu.</p>
    <p>For more screen space, rotate to landscape and tap Fullscreen when your browser supports it. Rotation alone cannot grant fullscreen permission. Launching from the home-screen icon removes the browser address bars; the OS may still show status indicators.</p>
    <p class="install-note">Load once online over HTTPS to cache all five courses across three trails for offline rides. An HTTP Wi-Fi link is for browser playtesting only, not full PWA installation.</p>
    <button id="install-now" class="primary" hidden>Install Dustline ${Wt}</button>
  </dialog>
